| g4_mutual | sqlite | 11 | 3269.0 | 27456.6 | 0.12 | reciprocal-edge 2-cycle over the full graph |
| g5_triangles_from | sqlite | 1 | 42.1 | 6233.3 | 0.01 | 3-cycle through a start node, counted |
| g6_weighted_hop | sqlite | 193 | 12.9 | 336.5 | 0.04 | hop + weight range + target-score range |

Overall geomean ratio across 6 queries: **0.04**.

